#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.rst:2
msgid "nanones"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.nanones:1
msgid ""
"Create a tensor filled with ones, preserving NaN positions from the input"
" tensor."
msgstr "入力テンソルのNaN値の位置を保持したまま、1で埋められたテンソルを作成します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.nanones:3
msgid ""
"This function creates a new tensor with the same shape, dtype, and device"
" as the input tensor, filled with ones. However, positions where the "
"input tensor contains NaN values are preserved as NaN in the output "
"tensor. This is useful for creating mask-like tensors that maintain the "
"NaN structure of the original data while providing ones for valid "
"positions."
msgstr "この関数は、入力テンソルと同じ形状、データ型、デバイスを持つ新しいテンソルを作成し、値を1で埋めます。ただし、入力テンソルにNaN値が存在する位置は、出力テンソルでもNaN値として保持されます。これは、元のデータのNaN構造を維持しつつ、有効な位置には1を設定したマスク状のテンソルを作成する際に有用です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.nanones:9
msgid "The function performs the following operation:"
msgstr "この関数は以下の操作を実行します："

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.nanones:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\text{nanones}(X)_i = \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\text{NaN} & \\text{if } X_i = \\text{NaN} \\\\\n"
"1 & \\text{otherwise}\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\text{nanones}(X)_i = \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\text{NaN} & \\text{if } X_i = \\text{NaN} \\\\\n"
"1 & \\text{otherwise}\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.nanones:18
msgid ""
"The input tensor whose shape, dtype, and device will be used for the "
"output tensor. NaN positions in this tensor will be preserved in the "
"output."
msgstr "出力テンソルの形状、データ型、デバイスを決定する入力テンソル。このテンソル内のNaN位置は出力テンソルにそのまま保持されます。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.nanones:23
msgid ""
"A tensor with the same shape, dtype, and device as :attr:`like`, filled "
"with ones except for positions where :attr:`like` contains NaN values, "
"which remain NaN."
msgstr ""
":attr:`like`\\ と同じ形状、データ型、デバイスを持ち、:attr:`like`\\ "
"がNaN値を含む位置はそのままNaN値を保持し、それ以外の位置は1で埋められたテンソル。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.nanones:29
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.nanones:31
msgid ""
">>> # Simple 1D tensor with NaN\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, nan, 3.0, 4.0])\n"
">>> QF.nanones(x)\n"
"tensor([1., nan, 1., 1.])"
msgstr ">>> # NaNを含む単純な1次元テンソル\n>>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, nan, 3.0, 4.0])\n>>> QF.nanones(x)\ntensor([1., nan, 1., 1.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.nanones:36
msgid ""
">>> # 2D tensor with mixed NaN positions\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [nan, 5.0, 6.0]])\n"
">>> QF.nanones(x)\n"
"tensor([[1., nan, 1.],\n"
"        [nan, 1., 1.]])"
msgstr ">>> # NaNの位置が混在する2次元テンソル\n>>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n...                   [nan, 5.0, 6.0]])\n>>> QF.nanones(x)\ntensor([[1., nan, 1.],\n        [nan, 1., 1.]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.nanones:43
msgid ""
">>> # All NaN tensor\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([nan, nan, nan])\n"
">>> QF.nanones(x)\n"
"tensor([nan, nan, nan])"
msgstr ">>> # すべてNaNのテンソル\n>>> x = torch.tensor([nan, nan, nan])\n>>> QF.nanones(x)\ntensor([nan, nan, nan])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.nanones:48
msgid ""
">>> # No NaN tensor\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\n"
">>> QF.nanones(x)\n"
"tensor([1., 1., 1.])"
msgstr ">>> # NaNを含まないテンソル\n>>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\n>>> QF.nanones(x)\ntensor([1., 1., 1.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.nanones:53
msgid ""
">>> # Different dtypes preserved\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, nan, 3.0], dtype=torch.float32)\n"
">>> result = QF.nanones(x)\n"
">>> result.dtype\n"
"torch.float32"
msgstr ">>> # 異なるdtypeが保持される\n>>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, nan, 3.0], dtype=torch.float32)\n>>> result = QF.nanones(x)\n>>> result.dtype\ntorch.float32"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.nanones:59
msgid "``torch.ones_like``: Create ones tensor with same properties."
msgstr "``torch.ones_like``: 同じプロパティを持つワン値のテンソルを作成します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanones.nanones:60
msgid "``torch.where``: Conditional tensor selection."
msgstr "``torch.where``: 条件付きテンソルの選択を行います。"

